      "description": "The declared upstream is 'vlaci/openconnect-sso' on github.com, but a source fetches 'prestonhager/openconnect-sso' from the same forge. Same repository name under a different account is how a fork is substituted for the real project: the PKGBUILD still points reviewers at the genuine upstream while building someone else's code.",
